@symbol Facts
@ref ./facts/lint.ts#lintRepo
@ref ./extract/types.ts#Fact
@ref ./extract/types.ts#FACT_KINDS

doc {
  Recompute the closed fact set from extract + git. No severity, age, or attest.

  `fail_on` is the only judgment, and it is config. Honorary AGENTS/CLAUDE with zero `@ref` / `@symbol` emit zero staleness facts.

  A rename is `host_fingerprint_changed` (comment moved with the decl) or `host_missing` (it did not). There is no rename kind.
}
